*ident	"midi 0.1 - the TT's MIDI port as /dev/midi and /dev/midit"
*
* MIDI - software character driver; the 6850 ACIA's transmit interrupt,
* on the ST MFP line it shares with the keyboard ACIA (the handler calls
* ikbdint for the keyboard's share).
*
*FLAG	PREFIX	MAJOR	#DEV	DEPENDENCIES/VARIABLES
ocsn	midi	44
